OL,5,G1200 Cruising with Susan Calman
OL,6,     FSusan embarks on her most
OL,7,     Fadventurous cruise, going through
OL,8,     FIndia for a river cruise on the
OL,9,     FGanges, visiting iconic cities,
OL,10,     Fexploring markets, and
OL,11,     Fexperiencing the culture.
OL,12,G1300 Cruising with Susan Calman
OL,13,     FSusan explores Kolkata, Kalna's
OL,14,     Ftemples, Murshidabad's colonial
OL,15,     Fpast, and bonds over cricket. She
OL,16,     Fends her journey in Chandannagar,
OL,17,     Fwith floating lanterns on the
OL,18,     Friver.
